  "path": "technical",
  "turns": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "text": "Probably a managed platform, we do not have servers.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "text": "It has to work with the spreadsheet we use today and maybe the email system.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "text": "A coding agent will build it, with me reviewing.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "text": "I know spreadsheets well, not much else.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "text": "We would like version one in about two months.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "text": "The budget is small, a few hundred euros a month at most.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "text": "About twenty people at launch.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "text": "Nothing special, just keep personal data private.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "text": "Our cleaning company plans shifts in a shared spreadsheet and people double book. We want a small tool to assign cleaners to sites. Constraints: single sign-on through Azure AD, PostgreSQL, and an audit trail on every write.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["overview"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "text": "The dispatcher plans the week, cleaners see their own shifts and site managers confirm the work.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["users"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "text": "The dispatcher must be able to assign a cleaner to a site for a shift on a calendar.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R1"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "text": "The tool must refuse to double book a cleaner who is already on another site at that time.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R2"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "text": "Each cleaner should see their own shifts for the week on their phone.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R3"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "text": "The site manager must be able to confirm that the work was done for each shift.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R4"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "text": "At month end we need an hours export per cleaner as a CSV file for payroll.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R5"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "text": "Cleaners will want to swap shifts with each other, but that can come later.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R6"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "text": "An SMS reminder the evening before a shift would be nice, later on.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R7"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "text": "When a cleaner reports sick, their shifts must be flagged so the dispatcher can reassign them.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R8"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "text": "A mobile friendly web app is enough, hosted on a managed platform, with email notifications. Stack: TypeScript, Postgres, REST with an OpenAPI description, deployed in containers.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["technical"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "text": "A mobile friendly web app is enough, hosted on a managed platform, with email notifications.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["technical"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "text": "Sites, cleaners, shifts and confirmations, and a shift belongs to one site and one cleaner.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["data"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "text": "We export hours to the payroll provider as a CSV every month.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["integrations"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "text": "Cleaners see only their own shifts, dispatchers see everything.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
